#: scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 582c0f5e8cd451454e88695cac984644e047297d1f3e6dbc396b73ca19e4a6e5
#. default-sha256: 391879f28a35bc87bd1014798b050bf70524d0f27be4fd270a7eb29c8e3a0bb2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The room with the fireplace was always kept in pristine "
"condition so they could entertain guests at any time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫La pièce avec la cheminée était toujours d’une propreté "
"irréprochable, de sorte à pouvoir accueillir des invités à tout moment."

#: scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 481dd47871e3398df661ad4b6b1c061ce26364cbaae01543a8c8d13304065129
#. default-sha256: 379f15150dcb6be031ab1a6ff29cc26647d39d848ff3e4b82ed3d61d851ffd08
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Walls colorfully decorated with tapestries and stained-glass windows gave testament to their "
"great fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les murs, décorés de tapisseries et de fenêtres au verre teinté, déployaient leurs couleurs "
"vives ; l’ensemble témoignait de leur grande fortune."

#: scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8162f9fb5783f0e176953dd97feb2da2ec0a3778f6e1c2d93cf9451abb75e203
#. default-sha256: d091696f95e54792f20812f5707d7efe0dcf576abf34505dc82c8243e946db9e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The servants’ first assignment every morning was to clean this room."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Chaque matin, la première tâche des serviteurs était de nettoyer cette pièce."

#: scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 819cd0e4028b1461349e9b9635a15c19db27eea62a7cb8842760a1b404f81a4c
#. default-sha256: 49e2155f471eb8869126de076ea6002301e3b37c20e4ef4d8a227345510ea566
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pitchers, silver plates, and silverware were polished to a shine so they could be proudly "
"put to use at a moment’s notice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Carafes, assiettes et couverts en argent étaient polis jusqu’à briller de mille feux : on "
"pouvait ainsi les sortir fièrement à n’importe quel moment."

#: scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b722e3c40b20f016ac0b082b5e47078767f515c9c919e539c869a3304b1bd9ce
#. default-sha256: d1e344e3eb7fd03cdde27246fe50902797d4de7404d401ec456962e7a6d02e5b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And for events like their daughter’s birthday, the room served an even more important role."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et pour des réceptions comme l’anniversaire de leur fille, la pièce jouait un rôle encore "
"plus important."

#: scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da84e003db78663645111909368b8b3a3140506500bdd3bd037494f8d62db569
#. default-sha256: fc5a2ff1fd547176104d3098c68451071abf09aad4b93e183f79e75ed3126284
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tables’ tops were removable, so they had ordered new tabletops with designs made "
"especially for this occasion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le revêtement des tables était amovible, alors ils avaient commandé de nouvelles nappes "
"ornées de motifs spécialement prévus pour cette occasion."

#: scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa73fa512fc4ba76cc7a12c2270529b35958e07abde256eba1831b9cae0aa5ea
#. default-sha256: 7f83d8cad37cff40c5175a0fc236981e53b77892a21e96ebf0a45b6cc1e10cd7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And once the banquet had drawn to a close, tables speckled with half-empty wine glasses and "
"leftover candied fruits were moved off to the side to make room for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫of course—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"the festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et une fois que le banquet toucha à sa fin, on déplaça les tables recouvertes de verres à "
"vin à moitié vides et de restes de fruits confits pour laisser la place –⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫bien sûr—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫ aux festivités."

#: scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 417c217982e264fd835e00506f623faaafd7883122f36881f31d810f93e5c761
#. default-sha256: eff7f8a982587c20b0aaa739fc04b7a1c9ee5c1df4f31c01d5933f9657db7750
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Good evening, Lady Nellie!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You’re looking particularly lovely "
"today."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Bonsoir, dame Nellie !⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Vous êtes particulièrement ravissante "
"aujourd’hui."

#: scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26e69ca3a9acc1c84d7ab0927878e63dbcea56a9e0fc0c4b4cc5cff85a6c92d5
#. default-sha256: 1d95240300dadffb01f1602196110c22845c66f2b77cf2fc12e5410cca9dd454
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nellie, I had these jewels cut just for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nellie, j’ai fait tailler ces bijoux juste pour vous."

#: scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1763f8dbd4352c384c5ebddfb01f2a1689934c4f8507f6103f37a1dbdb0094e9
#. default-sha256: 340d4bafbba16af48bc0e0f572a6b44a56473e6452252aa876323a74c8d8cb72
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’ll let me have this dance, won’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vous voudrez bien m’accorder cette danse ?"

