"⟪k:18⟫............⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Haaaaaaaann..."

#: scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da3ae19d83b710bf885acff04818cbe00a5f3f4b3a66d98d87db9b70c165d7ca
