msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s the matter, Nellie?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You look exhausted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Qu’y a-t-il, Nellie ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tu as l’air épuisée."

#: scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17e02f78502dde6fc97abf5624c0b597dfe23c733f46936fa2c0f45661532db8
#. default-sha256: e37055437554ad2412efeb27c0f80ec92e795591b2483d9550073b81111b3730
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫These are pretty good.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Want one? ⟪k:5⟫I know you like sweets.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"They’re apples candied in rock sugar, I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elles sont plutôt bonnes.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tu en veux une ? ⟪k:5⟫Je sais combien tu aimes "
"les sucreries.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Ce sont des pommes recouvertes de sucre glace, je crois."

#: scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 490b508d1932ce17d0ab2e6dc35ad6c46e230955c09252a2ce1a93a9fdb522ff
#. default-sha256: 70e6a694daa9cc8a7df96f11ff0d14c651528fc70aed6726a17010b8b56ba106
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You disappoint me, dearest Mell."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mon cher Mell, tu me déçois."

#: scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b85e65f98007445b669df2026b9ece3c98c3714da3674f3b0c105e6dd34ba3b
#. default-sha256: 8455a5ea8ec0a901287dd1d90bda97e6bddb0f74599676858fd936b549b376bf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Er?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Euh ?"

#: scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90438f62cd242e140b7c9cd60b15cde9868df0d66ce03241fabc2845d76ad8da
#. default-sha256: 4bd38b3faaacbe52d6e49ea66fd3456d286e88e1cb8dcb581bf8873222735a9a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What do you ⟪k:2⟫think⟪k:3⟫ is the matter?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They just keep ⟪k:6⟫coming⟪k:7⟫. "
"It never ⟪k:8⟫ends⟪k:9⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Que se passe-t-il, ⟪k:2⟫à ton avis⟪k:3⟫ ?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ils ne cessent de ⟪k:6⟫venir⟪k:7⟫. "
"Cela ne ⟪k:8⟫s’arrête⟪k:9⟫ jamais."

#: scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34db74bade6681599ee67ce41090d7a17a61d428a419f9621de60eb1bce55bf3
#. default-sha256: 66bda47fcdefcf3b01422b51f8f49c713d8b1bc6cd870a5cb3cd99f0d7ae1027
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s driving me up the wall.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Everyone’s just repeating the same lines they’ve "
"been taught.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They all think pretty jewels and requests to dance are enough to make a "
"girl swoon."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ça me rend chèvre.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tout le monde répète les mêmes phrases apprises par cœur."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ils croient tous que de jolis bijoux et des invitations à danser suffisent à faire "
"défaillir les jeunes filles."

#: scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcc8e5598f77eaf5722ceae1e9ddccf72abaa71c19c92902370f6f7b276d806d
#. default-sha256: 927e8242ce37cf6471d347e2e69b61e93f04a4feb064020e79530c66cdcec009
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(But I think that ⟪k:2⟫is⟪k:3⟫ true for you, Nellie.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Euh... Je crois bien que ⟪k:2⟫c’est vrai⟪k:3⟫ en ce qui te concerne, Nellie.)"

#: scenario:scenario_BA226F13_9347_408F_AC5B_C26B4A5BDFB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a2d413316b2b3f865df41a32a35ad07d0245c80ef3798b1f9d22bb94f1d7c94
#. default-sha256: 8dc21f97919b4f08b79cf6d214b88ae35ca05bd49b024ec26f5049977a283284
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BA226F13_9347_408F_AC5B_C26B4A5BDFB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Though... ⟪k:2⟫why is she disappointed with me?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Mais... ⟪k:2⟫en quoi l’ai-je déçue ?)"

#: scenario:scenario_4E973416_1EE7_46FA_86CD_CB839058D2EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 766420c072e0cc8a23fb870151b26fe4b82d48c772d77855c49b730a00f0a5a4
#. default-sha256: d969b430e35041e6a058c735912baccb5d95c9afa9101dff89b5a54d923d79ec
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4E973416_1EE7_46FA_86CD_CB839058D2EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Uggggh, I think I’m done with birthday parties after this year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Rahhhhh, je crois que je ne ferai plus de fête d’anniversaire désormais."

#: scenario:scenario_F4C7CEBA_FFC0_4989_80F1_0B18359A4581
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1388a85e190602aaea19fa05416fc2b76b49dd3c2ffd11c299053bb73463273c
