msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’ll probably throw an even bigger one next year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ils t’en organiseront probablement une encore plus grande l’année prochaine."

#: scenario:scenario_CD0AD072_93C9_4C07_88DF_F34C115B1CF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83b557938fab2e38057929e40e07eccba6e1350f23e6a19a847d311b11b9541b
