msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nellie’s skirt fluttered along with her as she stepped in time to the music. ⟪k:3⟫"
"She was not only a skilled singer, but a skilled dancer as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La jupe de Nellie flottait au gré de ses mouvements en rythme avec la musique. "
"⟪k:3⟫Son talent ne s’étendait pas qu’au chant, elle dansait aussi très bien."

#: scenario:scenario_0FE7527D_9FFD_42C4_B949_FB69FE44D819
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63685ce14ba7420c030cf58b7fb836178a7d106d3a3a26053bdb19d5e035b4d9
#. default-sha256: e05dc98d4e601b8cede802292d6ed2bdb5d0bfc31e8c00bfe43270ba130da675
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FE7527D_9FFD_42C4_B949_FB69FE44D819"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell, on the other hand, fumbled over his own feet trying to keep up. ⟪k:1⟫One would be hard-"
"pressed to describe his dance abilities as “good,” even as flattery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell, d’un autre côté, s’emmêlait les pieds en essayant de la suivre. ⟪k:1⟫On aurait "
"beaucoup de mal à décrire ses capacités comme étant « bonnes », même en le flattant."

#: scenario:scenario_2F0D3F6C_E102_4BAC_BC8F_248411697685
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d85aaf8277be59790cd6c040ea8f2dffe477a0647067823b423a011d5b899d15
#. default-sha256: 64c5ca81b004fc2ccc1d9242f3e831ed20e4380b7f0936f4dcd6d9f0bb789b0f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0D3F6C_E102_4BAC_BC8F_248411697685"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though boys of his pedigree were taught to dance as part of their etiquette lessons, he "
"found himself more being dragged around by his sister. ⟪k:1⟫He could hardly be said to be "
"“attending” to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait beau avoir reçu, comme tous les garçons de son rang, des leçons de danse dans ses "
"cours de bienséance, il se sentait davantage traîné alentour par sa sœur. ⟪k:1⟫Il n’aurait pas pu "
"dire qu’il « dirigeait »."

