#: scenario:scenario_1793C260_8672_4F68_8AF1_A79776213C40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2543ece47f4652afe8528024e51d2d1b6e0f5ef94daf33d1344a89fa1f8fe8d
