msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Because his parents had been hands-off in raising him, largely giving him free rein to "
"study and learn what he pleased, Mell looked like a tangled-up marionette."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Comme ses parents lui avaient laissé une grande marge de manœuvre dans son éducation, "
"en le laissant apprendre ce qu’il voulait, Mell ressemblait à une marionnette désarticulée."

#: scenario:scenario_B38D3DDA_0AD6_4373_87C9_4FF4EB6C9C48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
