msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was their parents who first cracked under the pressure. ⟪k:1⟫Just as their father was "
"about to give an exaggerated cough and stop the music,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce furent leurs parents qui craquèrent en premier sous la pression. ⟪k:1⟫Juste au moment où "
"leur père s’apprêtait à tousser de manière exagérée et à arrêter la musique,"

