msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He ordered the servants to investigate, had the music restarted, gave a short apology for "
"the interruption, and set the party back on course."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ordonna aux serviteurs d’aller voir sur place, relança la musique, s’excusa brièvement "
"pour l’interruption, et remit la fête sur pied."

