msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9ABF9CB4_570D_4FD5_AD53_F5B891C609DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The stretches of time with clear skies grew longer as summer approached, but the weather was "
"still somewhat unstable on the cusp of the two seasons."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le ciel était de plus en plus dégagé au fur et à mesure qu’on se rapprochait de l’été, mais "
"le temps restait quelque peu instable entre deux saisons."

#: scenario:scenario_0FFFB7F2_FB82_4B25_B132_BB24E1ECB83C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61d9794eac18d6a26e332277f397e4489451c666f3f7b881e7a2142b3b842c89
