msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FFFB7F2_FB82_4B25_B132_BB24E1ECB83C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had a strong wind that night as well, which turned the raindrops into little spears on "
"the window. ⟪k:1⟫Were the party to continue on any longer, no one would be able to go home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le vent soufflait fort cette nuit-là, ce qui transformait les gouttes en petites lances qui "
"frappaient les fenêtres. ⟪k:1⟫Si la fête se prolongeait, personne ne serait alors en mesure de "
"rentrer chez soi."

#: scenario:scenario_34F956BC_01B8_4DCF_A197_572FFE54D844
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
